Sum with sorted data:

Name:           sum()
Description:    Given a sorted array of integers and a target value, find two numbers whose sum equals the target
Input:          Array of data and target number to sum to
Output:         Position of two numbers whos sum is the target
Complexity:

SETUP:
create temp array to ensure the algorithm is pure and sorted
int left = 0
int right = data.length - 1


// LOGIC:
while left is less than right:
    sum = data[left] + data[right]
    if sum is equal to target:
        Return the positions of the two numbers
    else if sum is less than target:
        Increment left
    else:
        Decrement right


// OUTPUT:
left and right